+# Copyright (c) 2026, HUAWEI CORPORATION.  All rights reserved.
+#
+# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
+"""Self-tests for the Qwen3.8-Flash-Next QSA port.
+
+Three layers, each runnable on its own:
+
+1. import smoke -- the package must import and ``qsa_sparse_supported`` must report the
+   power-of-two / ``QSA_SPARSE_KERNEL`` gating;
+2. CPU reference -- the bool-mask and token-index encodings of one selection must
+   describe the same key set, and both must match the transformers
+   ``Qwen4ExpTextQSAIndexer`` on the same weights and inputs;
+3. NPU sparse kernel -- ``qsa_sparse_attention_thd`` against a per-row gather+softmax
+   reference, plus the ``QSA_SPARSE_KERNEL=0`` mask path.
+
+Usage::
+
+    python -m mindspeed_bridge.models.qwen4_exp.modelling_qwen4_exp.qsa.tests.test_qsa
+    python .../qsa/tests/test_qsa.py --cpu-only     # skip the NPU kernel test
+"""
+
